            "snippets": [
              "# Trump says he will meet China’s Xi at G20 next month\nUS President Donald Trump said on Monday that he will meet Chinese President Xi Jinping and Russian President Vladimir Putin at the G20 gathering in Japan next month.\n\nTrump said he expects his discussion with Xi to be “very fruitful”, as the trade war between China and the United States intensified on Monday",
